@namespace Showcase.Web.Client.Pages

@page "/fa-button"

<DemoPageHeader Title="Buttons" ComponentName="FaButton" DocSlug="fa-button" />

<ComponentSubNav BaseRoute="/fa-button" />

<h2>Color variants</h2>
<p>Every base color is a separate class on top of <code>.fa-btn</code> — <code>Variant</code> just picks which one.</p>
<div class="fa-demo-preview">
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Primary">Primary</FaButton>
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Secondary">Secondary</FaButton>
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Outline">Outline</FaButton>
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Accent">Accent</FaButton>
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.OutlineAccent">Outline accent</FaButton>
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Danger">Danger</FaButton>
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.OutlineDanger">Outline danger</FaButton>
</div>
<div class="fa-class-legend">
    <div class="fa-class-legend-row"><span class="fa-class-legend-label">Primary</span><code>.fa-btn.fa-btn-primary</code></div>
    <div class="fa-class-legend-row"><span class="fa-class-legend-label">Secondary</span><code>.fa-btn.fa-btn-secondary</code></div>
    <div class="fa-class-legend-row"><span class="fa-class-legend-label">Outline</span><code>.fa-btn.fa-btn-outline</code></div>
    <div class="fa-class-legend-row"><span class="fa-class-legend-label">Accent</span><code>.fa-btn.fa-btn-accent</code></div>
    <div class="fa-class-legend-row"><span class="fa-class-legend-label">Outline accent</span><code>.fa-btn.fa-btn-outline-accent</code></div>
    <div class="fa-class-legend-row"><span class="fa-class-legend-label">Danger</span><code>.fa-btn.fa-btn-danger</code></div>
    <div class="fa-class-legend-row"><span class="fa-class-legend-label">Outline danger</span><code>.fa-btn.fa-btn-outline-danger</code></div>
</div>
<div class="fa-code-block"><code>&lt;FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Primary"&gt;Primary&lt;/FaButton&gt;
&lt;FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.OutlineDanger"&gt;Outline danger&lt;/FaButton&gt;</code></div>

<h2 class="fa-mt-5">Size, disabled &amp; responsive</h2>
<p><code>Size</code> is the shared <code>FaSize</code> scale (<code>XSmall</code>/<code>Small</code>/<code>Medium</code> default/<code>Large</code>/<code>XLarge</code>) — <code>Medium</code> renders with no extra class, same look as before <code>Size</code> existed. <code>Disabled="true"</code> uses the native <code>disabled</code> attribute. <code>Responsive="true"</code> stretches the button to 100% width below 720px — resize this window to try it.</p>
<div class="fa-demo-preview">
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Primary" Size="FaSize.XSmall">XSmall</FaButton>
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Primary" Size="FaSize.Small">Small</FaButton>
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Primary">Medium (default)</FaButton>
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Primary" Size="FaSize.Large">Large</FaButton>
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Primary" Size="FaSize.XLarge">XLarge</FaButton>
    <FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Primary" Disabled="true">Disabled</FaButton>
</div>
<div class="fa-code-block"><code>&lt;FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Primary" Size="FaSize.Small"&gt;Small&lt;/FaButton&gt;
&lt;FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Primary" Disabled="true"&gt;Disabled&lt;/FaButton&gt;
&lt;FaButton Variant="FaButtonVariant.Primary" Responsive="true"&gt;Full-width on mobile&lt;/FaButton&gt;</code></div>

<h2 class="fa-mt-5">As a link</h2>
<p>Set <code>Href</code> to render an <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> styled as a button instead of a <code>&lt;button&gt;</code> — same <code>.fa-btn</code> classes either way.</p>
<div class="fa-demo-preview">
    <FaButton Href="https://github.com/parrescence/FaFa" Target="_blank" Variant="FaButtonVariant.Secondary">Link styled as a button</FaButton>
</div>
<div class="fa-code-block"><code>&lt;FaButton Href="/reports" Variant="FaButtonVariant.Secondary"&gt;
    View reports
&lt;/FaButton&gt;</code></div>